WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:03.498
Unit fifteen. Online Relationships!

2
00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:08.022
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:11.370
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.035
Today we learn about Online Relationships. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:19.143
Online. Say it with me. Online!

6
00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:25.741
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

7
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.000
Grooming. Say it with me. Grooming!

8
00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:39.849
Personal information. Say it with me. Personal information!

9
00:00:43.353 --> 00:00:46.653
Photos. Say it with me. Photos!

10
00:00:50.096 --> 00:00:52.763
Meet. Say it with me. Meet!

11
00:00:56.285 --> 00:00:59.451
Report. Say it with me. Report!

12
00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:06.663
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

13
00:01:10.163 --> 00:01:20.257
Some people online are not who they say they are. Grooming is when a stranger builds trust to harm someone. Never share personal information or photos or meet alone, and report and tell a trusted adult.

14
00:01:20.307 --> 00:01:22.930
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:29.808
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.858 --> 00:01:31.008
Grooming!

17
00:01:31.808 --> 00:01:36.739
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.789 --> 00:01:37.939
Report!

19
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:44.932
Did you know? Asking you to keep a conversation secret is a common warning sign of online grooming!

20
00:01:44.982 --> 00:01:46.650
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.382 --> 00:01:55.753
Think and answer. What warning signs might show an online contact is unsafe?

22
00:01:55.803 --> 00:01:56.953
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.129 --> 00:02:02.982
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.032 --> 00:02:05.719
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

